check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4968146Z E                   '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4968554Z E                   'Prove access before relying on it: notion-fetch with id "self" '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4969121Z E                   'returns the workspace identity. If that call fails, say so explicitly '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4969762Z E                   'in the run output and in the initiative status update — a missing log '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4970223Z E                   'row is never silently acceptable.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4970554Z E                   '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4971038Z E                   'At step 3, alongside the initiative status updates, create one row in '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4971550Z E                   'the Example Grooming Log\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4972109Z E                   '(data source example-grooming-log-destination-id) for this pass:\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4972549Z E                   '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4972915Z E                   '  Run                titled EXACTLY grooming — grooming_pass @ '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4973330Z E                   "2026-09-01T12:00:00Z — this run's identity and the string the runner "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4973540Z E                   'looks your row up by\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.4973772Z E                   '  Date               the same timestamp, as a date\n'
