check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5446791Z             'so in the report as an environment limitation with the exact error '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5447023Z             'and proceed, marking every Cloudflare specific you could not ground '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5447237Z             'as ungrounded; you do **not** fall back to inferring Cloudflare '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5447455Z             'behaviour from `node_modules`, installed package files or export '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5447681Z             'maps. "Cloudflare docs unreachable, this answer is ungrounded" is '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5448262Z             'acceptable output — a confident guess presented as fact is not, and '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5448537Z             'is the exact failure this step exists to prevent. The 403 was '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5448771Z             'reported against `docs.cloudflare.com` while the real documentation '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5449012Z             'host is `developers.cloudflare.com`; record in the report which host '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5449220Z             'actually 403s, so the next pass inherits the fact instead of the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5449478Z             'guess. Read the standing protocols from Notion — page '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5449797Z             'example-constitution-document-id, "Example — Operating Constitution". '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5450015Z             'Notion is a connector on this routine but its tools are deferred, so '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5450245Z             'load them with ToolSearch query "notion" before fetching. If the page '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5450464Z             'cannot be read, do the builds and the report but make no tree edits '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5450691Z             'this pass, and say why. Clone every declared repository and run its '
