check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5451180Z             'trunk, or on the stack head per principle 2 when the trunk is a '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5451366Z             'scaffold, and on gate failure apply principle 1a:\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5451504Z             '- example-repo (trunk `main`):\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5451800Z             '  - install — `make install`, a gate: its failure is a root cause\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5452034Z             '  - typecheck — `make type-check`, after install\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5452230Z             '  - lint — `make lint`, after install\n'
