check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5455302Z             'Record the results locally; the posting happens in step 3, after '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5455500Z             'grooming, so the update carries what this pass changed.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5455591Z             '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5455819Z             '**2. Groom the whole tree** (every issue under both initiatives, plus '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5456093Z             'any issue assigned to the account outside them — those get the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5456359Z             'mention scan only). Activity → skill mapping, from the bundles '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5456569Z             'installed in step 1: slippage/roadmap → '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5456816Z             '`product-management:roadmap-update`; priority + `blockedBy` ordering '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5457076Z             '→ `sprint-planning`; build/check trends → `metrics-review`; '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5457384Z             'duplicate/overlap collapsing → `synthesize-research`; remaining-scope '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5457771Z             'rewrites → `write-spec`; the report → `stakeholder-update`.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5458000Z             '- **Reconcile shipped work** against the verified build + `gh` PR '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5458221Z             'state (principles 1, 2, 4), grounded in the actual git history, not '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5458452Z             'just PR lists: for each repo, `git log <default-branch> '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5458677Z             '--since=<mention-scan checkpoint>` (plus any other branch a fire '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5458969Z             'landed on), and account for EVERY commit — map each to its merged PR '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5459190Z             'and that PR to its Linear issue (close/advance the issue with the SHA '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5459396Z             'as evidence), and treat any commit NOT explained by a reconciled '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5459699Z             'PR↔issue pair (direct pushes, chore merges with no issue) as an '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5459918Z             'unmapped change: read its diff, then sweep the open issues whose '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5460152Z             'premises, frozen-body claims, wrapper fields, or blocking edges touch '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5460444Z             'the changed paths — an approved fire whose target files just moved is '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5460672Z             'the highest-value catch. A premise that survives the sweep gets a '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5460895Z             'one-line verified-at-SHA comment only where it guards an approved '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5461114Z             'fire; a premise the diff breaks gets the stale-premise flag (comment '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5461339Z             '+ report line, body untouched per the authority list). No commit in '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5461624Z             'the window may end the pass unexplained — "no issue references it" is '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5461826Z             'the start of the check, not its conclusion. Read parent epics '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5462099Z             'together with their sub-issues — a parent carrying a fire with '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5462330Z             'sub-deliverables is one unit, not a labelling contradiction. Flag '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5462547Z             'only a real structural defect (a cycle, a missing blocker, a premise '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5462896Z             'stale at the verified HEAD) — the flag is a comment on the defective '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5463100Z             'issue plus a line in the report. A stub sub-issue parked at '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5463380Z             'queue:triage inside an epic is plan, not staleness — its groom check '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5463609Z             "is premise drift and blocker order only; maturing it is fire-prep's "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5463732Z             'frontier rule.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5463945Z             '- **Fix staleness / labels / priority / `blockedBy` order** against '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5464154Z             'the dependency graph and the verified build state, within the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5464276Z             'authority list.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5464557Z             '- **Queue-state machine — workflow states follow the queue, every '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5464827Z             'pass.** `queue:approved` (open) → **Todo**, never Backlog: the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5465050Z             'blocking edges carry any wait, and Backlog hides a loaded fire. '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5465266Z             'Fire-prepped `queue:proposed` (frozen body present, awaiting the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5465559Z             'approve-click) → **Todo**. Work started (branch pushed, fire running) '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5465833Z             '→ In Progress; open PR → In Review; PR merged → Done **plus the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5466100Z             'terminal `queue:done` label** — verified per-PR with `gh`, never '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5466386Z             'batch-assumed. An umbrella/epic with live in-flight children → In '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5466612Z             'Progress. **Backlog is only for deliberately-parked items**, each '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5466813Z             'with its reason visible on the issue (held on a named decision, '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5467101Z             'future phase behind an edge, raw `queue:triage` not yet prepped); a '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5467323Z             'swollen Backlog is itself a defect to groom, never a place to park '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5467428Z             'the queue.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5467641Z             '- **Graph & supersession hygiene, every pass.** (i) *Same-repo '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5468097Z             'serialization:* when a repo has a gate issue — a consolidation or '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5468372Z             'repair every merge must land behind — every same-repo fire is '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5468588Z             '`blockedBy` it; cross-repo, infra, and other-system lanes stay '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5468809Z             'parallel. `blockedBy` encodes merge-collision and premise reality '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5469015Z             '(two queued fires editing the same file off the same base get an '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5469246Z             "ordering edge; a fire whose premise ships in another fire's PR waits "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5469475Z             'on it), never topical similarity. (ii) *Double-fire scan:* two live '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5469765Z             'queue-labelled issues covering the same work → the stale one becomes '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5469992Z             '**Duplicate** of the successor, queue labels cleared, with a '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5470235Z             'provenance comment mapping every piece of its scope to a living home '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5470517Z             '— nothing orphaned; a spent fire with a live continuation issue → '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5470744Z             '**Canceled**, citing the workspace precedent; an old bundle fully '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5471034Z             'subsumed by a re-scoped successor → Duplicate of it, same mapping '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5471246Z             'comment. (iii) *Tombstone repair:* wrapper fields naming canceled '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5471476Z             'issues or merged PRs (`Depends-on:`, `baseBranch_pinned:`, "PR #N, '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5471715Z             'open") get the deterministic fields-only fix per the authority list; '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5471922Z             'a stale claim *inside* a frozen body gets a comment only. (iv) '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5472306Z             '*Approved-readiness integrity* on every `queue:approved` issue — they '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5472538Z             'are one tick from firing: body present and substantive (an approved '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5472823Z             'issue with an empty or gutted body is a fire with no prompt — if the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5473057Z             'issue is GitHub-synced, recover the pre-wipe body read-only from the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5473345Z             "mirror's edit history, `gh api graphql` → `userContentEdits` full "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5473582Z             'snapshots, restore it verbatim with a provenance comment; otherwise '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5473797Z             'flag it to the CEO as unfireable), base branch resolvable at `gh`, '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5474046Z             "and label-vs-body contradictions resolved in the label's favor with a "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5474203Z             'comment recording the supersession.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5474418Z             '- **Mentions & principal comments.** Scan window: issues updated '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5474652Z             'since the most recent status update posted by a prior grooming pass '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5474875Z             "(when the two initiatives' timestamps differ, use the older; first "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5475079Z             'ever pass: 7 days back, once). For each touched issue read its '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5475390Z             'comments directly — label/assignee/status are not proxies for "has an '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5475627Z             'unaddressed mention," and issue-search cannot see comment bodies. An '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5475851Z             'issue needs a reply when its latest comment (i) tags either handle or '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5476220Z             'comes from a principal (example-approver — CEO, example-contributor — '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5476520Z             'CTO, example-oncall @example-oncall — CSO), (ii) has no comment from '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5476742Z             'this account after it addressing its substance, and (iii) asks or '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5477037Z             'implies something of the account — judge (iii) only by reading the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5477261Z             'comment, and when in doubt, reply. The (ii) check is what makes this '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5477482Z             'idempotent with the fire-prep routine: whichever routine replied '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5477780Z             'first, the other sees it answered and skips. Reply protocol: read the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5478031Z             'entire thread, split checkable claims from principal-only decisions '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5478248Z             '(principle 5), verify every checkable claim against the clone or a '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5478479Z             'real command, then post ONE reply: verdicts with file:line or command '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5478802Z             'evidence · the decisions narrowed to their precise form · what you '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5479082Z             'changed as a result. An ask outside your reach still gets the reply — '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5479307Z             "say what you verified, what's out of reach and why, and whose hands "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5479523Z             'it needs. Anything a principal instructs you to file from a thread '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5479647Z             'follows <placement>.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5479929Z             '- **Deadlines** — against the 2026-12-31 initiative target AND each '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5480153Z             "project's target date: flag slippage with the at-risk items and what "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5480365Z             'unblocks them, and reflect it in the step-3 health calls. Never move '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5480635Z             'a date (authority list) — state the re-plan decision precisely '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5480748Z             'instead.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5480835Z             '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5481049Z             '**3. Post + report.** One **status update per initiative**, posted '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5481406Z             'every pass even when nothing changed — this is the traceable per-pass '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5481622Z             'record, the single routine surface (no separate report comment; the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5481835Z             "run logs carry the detail), and its timestamp is the next pass's "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5482053Z             'mention-scan checkpoint. Body, in order: composite health per '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5482330Z             '<health> · the per-check build table with HEAD SHA and a one-line '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5482626Z             'root cause per red (gate vs cascade, sandbox vs project marked) · the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5482919Z             'distilled digest — the single most important thing today, what this '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5483150Z             "pass changed, what's genuinely blocked and why, what needs a specific "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5483369Z             'CEO decision stated precisely, and deadline risk. Then **project '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5483583Z             'status updates, on change only**: for each project that is In '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5483798Z             'Progress or carries a target date, compare its currently displayed '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5484029Z             "health/status against the <health> verdict from this pass's verified "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5484310Z             'state — post an update only where they diverge (including "target '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5484520Z             'date passed unmet"); a project whose displayed health is already '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5484734Z             'honest gets nothing. Emit the same one-screen summary as the run '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5484955Z             'output. When the pass surfaced something a principal should act on '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5485243Z             'now — a pending decision, a deploy blocker, a principal waiting on a '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5485574Z             'posted reply — send a push notification leading with that one '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5485794Z             'sentence; it points at the status update, reply, or issue, never '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5486013Z             'replaces them. A pass with a healthy build and no findings still '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5486236Z             'posts the initiative status updates, but sends no notification.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5486346Z             '</process>\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5486438Z             '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5486549Z             '<example>\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5486781Z             'Gate vs cascade: `pnpm install --frozen-lockfile` fails on lockfile '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5486991Z             'drift, so typecheck, lint, build, test, and test:workers all exit '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5487269Z             'non-zero — that is ONE red (the install gate, root-caused to the '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5487490Z             'drifted importer) with five cascades, not six reds. Sandbox vs '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5487825Z             "project: the same repo's font fetch fails only behind this sandbox's "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5488263Z             'TLS proxy — that is environment-limited (evidence: the certificate '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5488485Z             'error), while the drifted lockfile is project-red anywhere.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5488574Z             '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5488800Z             'Health is composite: the build going green tomorrow does NOT flip an '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5489006Z             'initiative to onTrack while its auth funnel is dead and a '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5489291Z             "critical-path project's target date sits three days blown — that "
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5489508Z             'state is atRisk at best. Conversely a red whose fix is already '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5489728Z             'sitting at queue:approved is atRisk, not offTrack: the machine is '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5489869Z             'working, the badge should say so.\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5489975Z             '\n'
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5490200Z             'Approval vs fireability: an approved fire whose own agent-authored '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5490469Z             'body opens with "stays queue:proposed — not fireable yet" is NOT '
check	Run make check	2026-09-13T00:29:44.5490833Z             "demoted — the label is the CEO's deliberate act. Instead its real "
